  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n0.005 × [(0.08 ÷ 0.002) - (0.012 ÷ 0.04)] ÷ 0.01\n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question\n\n⇒ 0.005 × [(0.08 ÷ 0.002) - (0.012 ÷ 0.04)] ÷ 0.01\n\n⇒ 0.005 × [(40) - (0.3)] ÷ 0.01\n\n⇒ 0.005 × [40 - 0.3] ÷ 0.01\n\n⇒ 0.005 × 39.7 ÷ 0.01\n\n⇒ 0.005 × 3970\n\n⇒ 19.85\n\n**∴ The required result will be 19.85.**",
